no-style-please-ghost
=====================

This project is a Ghost port of the Jekyll theme "no-style-please" by
Riccardo Graziosi (https://github.com/riggraz/no-style-please), originally
released under the MIT License with the following copyright notice:

    Copyright (c) 2020 Riccardo Graziosi

The CSS under `theme/no-style-please-ghost/assets/css/style.css` and the
overall template structure are derivative works of that project. The Ghost
Handlebars templates were written fresh for this port but follow the same
naming and responsibilities as the original Liquid layouts.

Reference implementation (for a second opinion on structure):
    hanwenguo/hugo-theme-nostyleplease — a Hugo port, also MIT-licensed.

